      "message": "Naming things is hard, but I think the name should emphasize that the variable will be static under its intended configuration, that way this macro is not misused to declare a (for example) stack variable.\n\nBut \"REQUIRES\" *is* a little funky.\n\nSome things I was thinking that might work instead (and may be less odd) is STATIC_WHEN/STATIC_UNLESS, STATIC_IF/STATIC_UNLESS, or if \"UNLESS\" is unclear, we could also do STATIC_IF_NOT?\n\nMy vote would be on STATIC_WHEN/STATIC_UNLESS, but curious to hear others\u0027 opinions.",
